      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "9ffd0c21bbbe8c96",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "[?] to beg them to deliver me from that distress, so that I might repent before God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "15fe3fe629900aac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "But the two answered, saying, “You are pleading in vain, for none of those who have come here goes out"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2664d7da9aad7432",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "or is released until the resurrection.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "ff7e019856f50bbe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "As I continued pleading and earnestly promising to repent,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "f9c1b29fac9ba409",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "one of them said to the other, “Will you stand surety for him, that he will repent before God with all his heart?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "05f776f52dd787f7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "The other angel answered, “I will stand surety.” And I seemed to see the one standing surety give him his right hand."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "eb15ff95fbf4a4dc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Then, having seen this, the two brought me up to the earth, into my grave and to my body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "404cfc3893d62a54",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "They said to me, “Enter that from which you were separated.” And I saw my own nature like a shining pearl, but the appearance of my dead body"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "d27eff48ec164cec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "was like muddy filth, foul-smelling and black, and I recoiled from entering it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9fed0517f000db3f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "But they said to me, “You cannot repent except in the body in which you sinned.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9a27ed159b75c5b7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "And as I pleaded again not to enter the body, they again said to me, “Enter your body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "c509a58d4a51f01f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "If so, we will take you to the place from which we brought you up. So enter, so that you may also be of benefit to others"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "01688faf40c5f47e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "against whom you have sinned.” And [?] received. Then I saw myself enter through my mouth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "1094debb371d7def",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Immediately I began to cry out and say, “Have mercy on me! Have mercy on me!” Then you brought me out. Then the great Thalassius said to him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "7cd5950247fb38d7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "“Eat some food.” But he would not. Instead, going from place to place to place in the church and falling on his face,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "f168e6a72489fbd6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he confessed to God with groaning and tears, saying, “Woe to those who sin,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "9d5e813672a4e52e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and to those awaiting torment! Woe to those who do not repent while they still have time!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "50fcfff5f55bfcf3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Woe to those who defile their own bodies!” After forty days, he departed pure to the Lord,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "cfce1193a221210f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "having known of his death three days beforehand. Trustworthy fathers who had gone there and seen him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "6de71415ec30653f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "told us these things for our benefit. To God belong glory, power, and worship, with the Father who has no beginning,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/narratio-de-milite#Supr.85v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "63edc4e6b9a2d73b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and with the Son and the life-giving Spirit, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
